{"text": "Then he stepped on something that looked like a log. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But it was really the Crocodile, and he winked one eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Come closer, Little One, said the Crocodile, I am the Crocodile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he began to cry crocodile tears to show it was true. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The Elephants Child knelt down on the bank and came closer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have been looking for you for so many days, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Will you please tell me what you have for dinner. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Come closer, and I will whisper it, said the Crocodile. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So the Elephants Child put his head close to the Crocodiles mouth. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Snap, The Crocodile caught him by his little nose. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I think today I will begin with Elephants Child, said the Crocodile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", "n", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "e", "p", "p", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "t", "h", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "l", "o", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "i", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "r", "e", "a", "l", "l", "y", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "C", "r", "o", "c", "o", "d", "i", "l", "e", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "w", "i", "n", "k", "e", "d", " ", "o", "n", "e", " ", "e", "y", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "C", "o", "m", "e", " ", "c", "l", "o", "s", "e", "r", ",", " ", "L", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "O", "n", "e", ",", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "C", "r", "o", "c", "o", "d", "i", "l", "e", ",", " ", "I", " ", "a", "m", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "C", "r", "o", "c", "o", "d", "i", "l", 